{"synopsis":"Seorang makhluk terasing yang telah kehilangan segalanya hidup dengan berburu monster di dalam dungeon dan bertahan hidup dari sisa-sisa yang ada. Setelah waktu yang lama, ia kembali ke kampung halamannya—sebagai Maru Grasse, makhluk yang telah kehilangan segalanya. Dihina dan dijauhi oleh semua orang, Maru hanya menemukan makna hidup saat memasak dan menikmati hidangan dari monster dungeon. Dengan pisau dan panci sebagai senjatanya, ia memulai perjalanan bertahan hidup, sekaligus membalas dendam pada naga yang merenggut keluarga, rekan, dan tanah kelahirannya.","alternative_title":"던전 미식가","author":"Battalion Member, Kanojyo","artist":"Na Jungyoung","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"56d48da5-344e-46cd-b443-92024e871675","number":"52","chapter":"52","title":"","date":"2026-07-30","released":"2026-07-30"},{"chapter_id":"0ad00828-22cf-4766-9c16-52cb002e4e0e","number":"51","chapter":"51","title":"","date":"2026-07-24","released":"2026-07-24"},{"chapter_id":"c5e6701b-e6c4-4a67-a200-045a92afc779","number":"50","chapter":"50","title":"","date":"2026-07-04","released":"2026-07-04"},{"chapter_id":"fb65b799-4361-4d4b-aa5a-17dcacac4020","number":"49","chapter":"49","title":"","date":"2026-06-13","released":"2026-06-13"},{"chapter_id":"81a821c7-8113-420e-a391-374a7bdc0ec6","number":"48","chapter":"48","title":"","date":"2026-06-12","released":"2026-06-12"},{"chapter_id":"a4d75ee3-2610-4dfa-b486-f38b739ad4b7","number":"47","chapter":"47","title":"","date":"2026-06-12","released":"2026-06-12"},{"chapter_id":"df3455c8-63a2-421b-97c8-4fd2d156a308","number":"46","chapter":"46","title":"","date":"2026-05-29","released":"2026-05-29"},{"chapter_id":"16f7edbe-27cd-47b5-ad6b-1d63a54e6db4","number":"45","chapter":"45","title":"","date":"2026-05-21","released":"2026-05-21"},{"chapter_id":"d1565358-c1aa-493c-b347-ddb11e49db08","number":"44","chapter":"44","title":"","date":"2026-05-18","released":"2026-05-18"},{"chapter_id":"9051db59-d643-406f-8136-3eeb9b88525d","number":"43","chapte